    "title": "Warren County Grand Jury Returns 17 Indictments Against 10 Individuals in October Session - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Royal Examiner ,\n11 hours ago Charges include attempted malicious wounding, drug possession, felony DUI, obtaining money by false pretenses, gaming equipment tampering, and firearm offenses. A Warren County grand jury returned 17 indictments against 10 individuals on October 13, 2026, in Warren County Circuit Court. The charges involve alleged offenses dating from October 2023 through August 2026. Read full article\n2",
